79601518580, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/pilates-basics", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/27205dc2-3c4b-4854-85b1-8902f05745a3.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "普拉提入门", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 805.9316569954868, "slug": "pilates-basics", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780116810531, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779416207897, "description": "Use when the user asks for an implementation or development plan before coding, wants to avoid direct implementation, or requires explicit approval before edits. Trigger on phrases like \"先确定开发方案，别直接开发\", \"先给开发方案\", \"先设计实现方案\", \"参考项目的 harness engineering\", \"看下是否可以分多 agent\", \"plan before coding\", or \"implementation plan first\". Also use when the user says \"按你的推荐方案执行\" only if a concrete plan has already been presented in the current thread. Enforces a three-stage workflow: plan first without edits, assess one-agent vs multi-agent execution, then implement only after explicit approval.", "description_zh": ">-这个 skill 叫 plan-before-code，用于在编码前强制先做开发方案设计，适合需要受控开发、先评估再执行的代码任务。\n\n它会让 agent 在动手改代码前，先阅读项目规则和相关上下文，输出清晰的实现方案，包括改动范围、涉及模块、文件归属、验证命令、风险点和开放问题。只有在用户明确批准方案后，才进入实际实现阶段。\n\n适合用在这些场景：\n\n用户明确说“先确定开发方案，别直接开发”\n需要先评估实现路径、风险和影响范围\n需要判断任务适合一个 agent 做，还是可以拆成多个 agent 并行\n项目有严格的 harness、验证流程或工程规范\n用户希望先审批方案，再允许修改文件\n它的核心价值是避免 agent 过早动手，把开发过程拆成三个阶段：先规划、不改代码；再评估单 agent 或多 agent；最后在明确批准后执行。这对复杂项目、iOS 工程、需要视觉验证或有严格测试流程的仓库尤其有用。", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_104630ff/plan-before-code", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/81015f94-5620-494e-bbd6-ac3268e7ccd3.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "plan-before-code", "ownerName": "user_104630ff", "score": 805.9316569954868, "slu