用于：已有完整病例数据但需要学术写作支持的用户。", "description_zh": "｜", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_f8be9621/anes-case-generator", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a00e31c7-8d6a-4e65-84fc-16a177f95674.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "AnesCaseGenerator", "ownerName": "user_f8be9621", "score": 3424.6575342465753, "slug": "anes-case-generator", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780115013220, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779889185780, "description": "自动清理 WorkBuddy 删除对话后残留在默认输出目录的废弃文件夹。通过对 AI 说「帮我清理废弃文件夹」触发。", "description_zh": "自动清理 WorkBuddy 删除对话后残留在默认输出目录的废弃文件夹。通过对 AI 说「帮我清理废弃文件夹」触发。", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_3f399cbf/cleanup-stale-workspaces", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/7422abc7-fa86-4505-a723-0575c56e7a2d.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "过期对话残留文件夹清理", "ownerName": "user_3f399cbf", "score": 3623.1884057971015, "slug": "cleanup-stale-workspaces", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780114719405, "version": "1.1.2"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779891840815, "description": "Excel多文件智能合并工具；自动对齐表头、过滤空行、适配列数；支持并行读取/分块处理/高效写入/格式保留；当用户需要合并多个Excel、汇总表格数据或整理报表时使用", "description_zh": "Excel多文件智能合并工具；自动对齐表头、过滤空行、适配列数；支持并行读取/分块处理/高效写入/格式保留；当用户需要合并多个Excel、汇总表格数据或整理报表时使用", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_af28adda/excel-merge", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/e089b3bb-5a99-41bc-8881-40980028b748.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "Excel数据合并", "ownerName": "user_af28adda", "score": 4058.4415584415583, "slug": "excel-merge", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780114716398, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "creat